name arm-escape-frontal-1
timeout 200

# THE ESCAPE WINDOW, FRONTAL SHOT — and it is a MEASUREMENT against a PREDICTION, not a tuned outcome.
# doc/air-to-ground.md §Knowledge 1.
#
# One AGM-88 at 20 km against an SA-6 that is 5 deg off the shooter's nose. The round's memory is a RATE
# and never a POINT: after the last reception the measured line-of-sight rate is held for SeekerMemoryS
# (4 s) and is then ZERO, so proportional navigation commands nothing lateral, the 1 g accelerometer
# bias survives and the round COASTS STRAIGHT. The miss that produces is exactly the zero-effort miss of
# the law already in the tree.
#
# THE PREDICTION doc/air-to-ground.md made: with ZEM(0) = R*sin(5 deg) = 1.74 km and N = 4, the crew's
# boundary sits at 61 % of the round's flight. THIS FILE SHUTS THE SITE DOWN AT EXACTLY 61 %
# (t = 39.47 s, against a measured 62.24 s time of flight from a release at t = 1.5 s) and the site
# LIVES with hundreds of metres to spare — the prediction is optimistic for the attacker, and the
# measured boundary is 85.0 %. The finding and its three named causes are in doc/air-to-ground.md §Gaps.
#
# The battery carries no rounds: this file measures the WEAPON, not an engagement.
#
# WHAT TO READ:
#   events.log      `missile SEEKER_ACTIVE ... mode=anti-radiation`, then `site GO_DARK why="emission
#                   plan"` at t = 39.5, then `missile EMITTER_LOST ... heldS=4`, then `stores IMPACT`
#   telemetry_weasel_agm88_1.csv  msl_range = -1 for the WHOLE flight (this seeker has no range),
#                   msl_tgt_age climbing from 0 once the transmitter stops — that column IS the memory
#
# READING RULE: exit 0 = SUCCESS (the weasel survived) is not the measurement. The MEASUREMENT is
# `UNIT_RESULT unit=sam`, and the only passing value is INTACT: a crew that goes dark at 61 % escapes.

runway 46.84335 6.91523 441.0 228.0 2889

unit weasel
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.63000 6.90000 4000 0.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr on
  set store 3 agm88
  set arm_class any
  set brief_master_arm arm
  set task route
  set brief_release_s 1
  wp 47.20000 6.90000 4000 450
  objective survive                         # the weasel is never shot at here; this makes exit 0 the pass

unit sam
  module sa6
  team hostile
  spawn 46.808955 6.922835 ground 0.0 0     # 20 000 m out, 5 deg off the weasel's nose at release
  set emcon free 39.47                      # off the air at 61 % of the measured 62.24 s flight
  set rounds 0
